    "en": {
      "trackName": "Single Tap Games: Watch Arcade",
      "description": "Six quick games for Apple Watch and iPhone. One tap to play.\n\n• Candy Land – climb the levels\n• Mini Soccer – score goals and beat your best\n• Goat Escape – dodge the fences and the lions\n• Simon – repeat the color pattern\n• The Builder – stack floor after floor and see how high your tower can go\n• Mars Invaders – blast waves of invading aliens in a retro arcade shooter\n\nPlay on your wrist, or on your iPhone, where each game runs on a watch shown on the screen. Your high scores sync between your Apple Watch and your iPhone, and Game Center leaderboards show how you rank against other players.\n\nThere's no sign-up and no ads. Chase your own high score whenever you have a minute to spare.\n\nGot a minute? Tap and play!",
      "releaseNotes": "• New: play all six games on your iPhone too\n• Game Center leaderboards for every game\n• High scores sync between your Apple Watch and iPhone\n• Bug fixes and improvements",
